  "_doc": "A toad queen so full of vent gas she floats half out of the water. P1 \"Bubbles\": her belches leave gas bubbles on the water (pools); her Spark ignites EVERY bubble at once — keep them away from the group. P2 at 50% \"Spawning\": she calls toads and her gas comes thicker; a Pop on herself throws everyone back.",
